  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Early Childhood Education Expansion and Improvement Program</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa para la Expansin y Mejoramiento de la Educacin Inicial</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Contribuir al mejoramiento de las condiciones de desarrollo de nios y nias mediante la ampliacin de cobertura de salas cuna y jardines infantiles, incorporando altos estndares de calidad en infraestructura, equipamiento y modelo de atencin. Los objetivos especficos son: (i) contribuir a la reduccin de brechas de atencin en educacin inicial mediante la expansin de cobertura, privilegiando a las familias de los quintiles ms pobres de la poblacin; y (ii) contribuir a la implementacin de la agenda de calidad de la educacin parvularia, mediante acciones que contribuyan al mejoramiento del desempeo pedaggico y la calidad de la experiencia educativa de los nios y las nias.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this operation is to support the process of expansion of early education services in Chile by increasing coverage and incorporating high standards in infrastructure, equipment and services Specifically, the program: (i) will support to close the service gaps by increasing coverage by building new centers; (ii) support the qualiy agenda for early education of the government by improving and enrichment the care and education experience of children attending the public early education centers.</narrative>
  </description>
